{
  "about": "LongLive 2.0, 2 steps (LongLive-2.0-5B-S2 model_te.pt), as its authors run it (LongLive2.0/configs/inference.yaml): BF16 weights, BF16 KV cache, SDPA attention, RoPE tables in float64, UniPC with shift 5 at the trained 704x1280, chunk 8, window 32 with a sink of 8, 128 latent frames. None of our speed-ups: an experiment that uses one says so in its own config (\"base\": this file, then what it changes).",
  "common": {
